 * SIV from
 * {@link https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8452 | RFC 8452}.
 *
 * GHASH   modulo: x^128 + x^7   + x^2   + x     + 1
 * POLYVAL modulo: x^128 + x^127 + x^126 + x^121 + 1
